LevelSelect is not open source.

This source is published so that anyone can verify what the app does with
their data — that the library lives in the user's own iCloud, that no
analytics or tracking exist, and that a RetroAchievements key never reaches
our servers. Those claims should be checkable rather than taken on trust.

Publishing it grants no license to use, copy, modify, merge, publish,
distribute, sublicense, or sell this software or substantial portions of it,
and no license to any trademark, app name, icon, or artwork in this
repository.

You may read the code, quote short excerpts with attribution (a review, an
article, a class you are teaching), and build it locally to inspect or
evaluate it.

Third-party components remain under their own licenses. Game metadata and
cover art are supplied by IGDB, achievement data by RetroAchievements, and
price data by Deku Deals; each is subject to that provider's terms and is
not covered by this notice.

For any other use, ask: support@levelselect.app
